{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0378_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "e538f427aa4be2b38be84e836c36cd21313273228324b0a4b259a32282786098", "ja": "『BATTLE OF THEATER』、開幕！", "zh": "『BATTLE OF THEATER』，开幕！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0378_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "9f228b8a9564ad7c0538c31fba045bd13fc381310be0972983ad6c3c5079b724", "ja": "『BATTLE OF THEATER』の\n開催宣言公演、開演直前。それぞれの想いと\n覚悟を胸に、静香、真、環、朋花、麗花、\nエミリーは円陣を組む。ステージに立った\n6人はそれぞれの言葉で、開幕を宣言する。", "zh": "『BATTLE OF THEATER』\n开幕宣言公演即将开始。在心中怀抱着各自的想法与觉悟，静香、真、环、朋花、丽花、艾米莉组成圆阵。登上舞台的6人用各自的话语，宣告演出的开始。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0378_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7af3df4f27e379eba0b1675afab4061ba5b03a7ee7a8312dbc40abd6e75f71fb", "ja": "（いよいよ『BATTLE OF THEATER』、その\n開催宣言公演の幕が上がろうとしている……）", "zh": "（终于，《BATTLE OF THEATER》的开幕宣言公演就要拉开帷幕了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0378_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_06_1001_032emi", "source_sha256": "9c5fa6e965232ea27c15353e3fb019cbb9311a971d3a4a687464a638458c6497", "ja": "髪型よし、お化粧よし、衣装よし。\n静香さん、確認完了です！　とっても素敵ですよ♪", "zh": "发型没问题，妆容没问题，服装也没问题。静香小姐，确认完毕！非常漂亮哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0378_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_06_1002_015siz", "source_sha256": "d3e0949e875c44feb26e84ba76d1f25c136d078ee54a4a2a012c6f5fe8bf0bb0", "ja": "ありがとう！\nエミリーも大丈夫、よく似合ってるわ。", "zh": "谢谢！\n艾米莉也完全没问题，非常适合你哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0378_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_06_1003_031tom", "source_sha256": "26606369922f2652c83ccc9e9a2843dc9a282946b339978f499cad840fab0fc0", "ja": "環ちゃん、麗花さん、笑顔をチェックしますよ～。\nふたりとも、笑ってください～？", "zh": "环、小丽花，我来检查你们的笑容哦～  \n两位都请笑一个～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0378_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_06_1004_040tam", "source_sha256": "a79be8a3f86471c7292506e092330151e751ac23cda46f5a9ea2b1e42027ad34", "ja": "はーい！　くふふ♪", "zh": "好——！咕呼呼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0378_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_06_1005_048rei", "source_sha256": "a8ea8dea4eda08f0ee197a57dfbf2acf13241972dc3a6a1e01a374fbdec63529", "ja": "朋花ちゃんも、笑って笑って！\nあっぷっぷ～！", "zh": "朋花，你也笑一个嘛！\n吹——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0378_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_06_1006_031tom", "source_sha256": "effb9646ef2ebeb2a4632490097441df683ecefec72187897e8913f117b90a61", "ja": "麗花さん……にらめっこではありませんよ～？\nうふふっ。", "zh": "丽花小姐……这不是斗眼游戏哦～？呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0378_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_06_1007_p", "source_sha256": "49cf386184260ebbca8d2812cfd11558dd4f522236131d0263c27545353a1516", "ja": "みんな、準備はできてるか？\nそろそろ舞台袖に移動しよう。", "zh": "大家，都准备好了吗？\n差不多该去侧台了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0378_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_06_1008_006mak", "source_sha256": "1adc9b8969fb9784a44433df80c97eebef597e9c119e0142b569122196ef3fd4", "ja": "{$P$}、その前に……\nみんな、集まって！　円陣組むよ！", "zh": "{$P$}，在那之前……\n大家集合！我们来围个圈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0378_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_06_1009_006mak", "source_sha256": "e507b1c5c83d721e1651949246bf3d366d536613c97982fd33a6108733105cec", "ja": "勝負する覚悟は決まったよね？\n今日はファンのみんなに、それを見せつけよう！", "zh": "已经下定决心要一决胜负了吧？\n今天就把这份决心展现给所有粉丝看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0378_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_06_1010_032emi", "source_sha256": "8e2985a66d6cbe58d2cdaa5b0b161b71ee8938466af1da36d427e63869d6aef3", "ja": "はい！　大和撫子として……\nみなさんの仲間として、恥じぬよう。堂々と。", "zh": "是！作为大和抚子……  \n作为大家的伙伴，我绝不能丢脸。要堂堂正正地。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0378_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_06_1011_015siz", "source_sha256": "6ac271c1fd0bad13577701c69351abf5a660529962a2188d0766ac41e8b0d364", "ja": "ええ。私も、みんなに負けないように……。\nううん、違うな。", "zh": "嗯。我也要为了不输给大家……  \n不，不对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0378_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_06_1012_015siz", "source_sha256": "4650b9e7de14c4e7c747da63c11b88fc139da7f6ff80a7a5d3a10217eb8ba0af", "ja": "負けないように、じゃなく。\n勝つために、挑みます！", "zh": "不是为了不输，\n而是为了获胜，我要发起挑战！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0378_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_06_1013_048rei", "source_sha256": "4cae0fec1ce08e1d4eec0780a93c87b8ee0a40a735ebfd909127ca39a76713f4", "ja": "うんうん、そうだね♪　「負けたくない」と\n「勝ちたい」じゃ、気持ちの乗り方が違うよね！", "zh": "嗯嗯，你说得对♪　“不想输”和\n“想赢”，投入的心情完全不一样呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0378_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_06_1014_006mak", "source_sha256": "16c0698e4f0ce9210a804c80aa93a539740a51617a6919a933d5a002148251a6", "ja": "よし、それじゃあ今日は……みんなで、勝ちにいこう！", "zh": "好，那么今天……大家一起，去赢下胜利吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0378_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_06_1015_006mak", "source_sha256": "8a4375548c543e80ee32382ccc842e68a3a5ca07dc3300133bc59b0aa2e50eb8", "ja": "765プロ、ファイトーッ！　おーっ！", "zh": "765艺能，加油——！喔——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
