{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0378_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_06_1022_015siz", "source_sha256": "901bc08781812e0abb9de16236b5f5518bd8c2e2cdfff1db63c40a87f36bbd70", "ja": "みなさーん！　今日は私たちの\n劇場にお越しいただき、ありがとうございます！", "zh": "各位朋友——！非常感谢大家今天来到\n我们的剧场！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0378_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_06_1023_audience", "source_sha256": "beba8aec9b1ea1b96f3b00fa484ac70c930b0103eb77ec90ea88231d91973576", "ja": "ワアアアアァァァーッ！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0378_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_06_1024_006mak", "source_sha256": "77325e495d3e9bc50f47bf596676144d7928e68576ac887bddf0ee1cc9a72696", "ja": "みなさんにとって、ボクたち765プロの\n印象って、どんな感じですか？", "zh": "在大家眼里，我们765事务所\n给人的印象是怎样的呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0378_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_06_1025_040tam", "source_sha256": "b1e18ae08e0a39eeea9f9ac7d6a09931104bbaed4b2a246fa6ae3f2b0c39444d", "ja": "みんな友達で、仲良しで……ケンカとかしない？", "zh": "大家都是朋友，关系很好……而且不吵架吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0378_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_06_1026_032emi", "source_sha256": "026c93d73b95774f98ca1c355c3551427101f6aee309dc58268c2dac050a3ac3", "ja": "でしたらそれは、すこしだけ違うかもしれません。\n好敵手だからこそ、戦うこともできる……と。", "zh": "如果是那样的话，或许就有些不一样了。\n正因为是彼此认可的对手，才可以交锋……吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0378_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_06_1027_031tom", "source_sha256": "6ac073fb3f6b2d8cdb242d6b99f76b5caa2386b45f5a84523a837e79a0dcd991", "ja": "私たちは確かに、お互いをリスペクトしています～。\nですが、だからこそ、遠慮はしないんですよ～。", "zh": "我们确实是互相尊重的哦～。\n但也正因如此，才不会对彼此客气呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0378_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_06_1028_006mak", "source_sha256": "248e8e110f1ef31067f6e1a6d12c4ef4bb1cf1a556480f473d2e2a2b1f7dcb48", "ja": "だから……ボクたちは、今日、ここに宣言します！", "zh": "所以……我们今天要在这里宣言！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0378_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_06_1029_031tom", "source_sha256": "2a5a9c4bd74bc7ad9ac40cf3faeaf452f35f9014774fba98ec407dcc97039ce4", "ja": "聖母として、子豚ちゃん達のため……", "zh": "为了小猪们，作为圣母……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0378_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_06_1030_032emi", "source_sha256": "4d729f3e9efe6beedfba21ad13eaf8b2ba391ac6b60ad4d05aef50044d7cfeed", "ja": "大和撫子として、譲れないもののため……", "zh": "身为大和抚子，为了不能退让的事物……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0378_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_06_1031_048rei", "source_sha256": "e7b64784e50e2845a6fc8fa5ce8079a5325b931f97d096e31dedade738f867f9", "ja": "ビュビューンって、全力で、楽しみながら！", "zh": "呼呼——要全力以赴，享受其中！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0378_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_06_1032_040tam", "source_sha256": "12fb18fde596fb57d87e7d73db4ee8523a3e76291d35e9da5c1b2b32a23fd1cf", "ja": "たまきも、いっしょうけんめい戦いぬくことを、\nちかうぞ～っ！", "zh": "环也发誓，要竭尽全力战斗到底～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
